====Usage notes====
Although {{m|en|first name}} is more common in all dialects of English, {{m|en|given name}}, {{m|en|personal name}}, &c. are increasingly preferred in multicultural contexts because of [[East Asia]] and other cultural traditions where such names are placed after the [[surname]] instead of before.

